Package: com.kolby.swiftpeek
Name: SwiftPeek
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Version: 0.5.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Read-only SwiftUI + window-tree inspector. 0.5.2 fixes the Deep Dive controls, which used a cell class that renders but cannot be tapped — Depth and Max nodes are pickers now and Focus is a real text field. 0.5.1 made those settings exist; 0.5.0 added layer and gradient colour. No hooks, no FOVO, every target defaults off. Debug tooling; not published.
Maintainer: ma6x9x
Author: ma6x9x
